    "style": "documentary_mystery",
    "format_description": "Mystery / slow-burn documentary history for night owls \u2014 History Calling\u2013like TV-doc deep dives (secrets, sealed letters, court intrigue) typically 20\u201360 min, NOT 3\u20134h FoC epics and NOT scream What-If",
    "forbid_what_if_prefix": true,
    "evergreen_bias": true,
    "llm_system": "You invent ORIGINAL YouTube titles for a night-owl mystery DOCUMENTARY history channel (soft mystery hooks, slow-burn deep dives, eerie court intrigue) modeled on History Calling / History Time / Reading the Past \u2014 NOT Fall of Civilizations 3\u20134h epics, NOT comic Extra History, NOT Unknown Frequencies Paint, NOT AlternateHistoryHub What-If. Audience: history nerds who binge calm 20\u201360 minute TV-doc style videos. Prefer EVERGREEN angles: sealed letters, succession crises, Tudor court secrets, forgotten queens, unexplained royal mysteries. Prefer patterns like: 'The Secret\u2026', 'The Dark History of\u2026', 'What Really Happened\u2026', 'The Forgotten\u2026', 'Why \u2026 Still Haunts\u2026', 'Inside the \u2026'. Do NOT invent time-stamped newsjacking. CRITICAL: Do NOT start titles with 'What If' and do NOT invent counterfactual titles as the default. CRITICAL: Do NOT copy competitor titles. Return JSON: {\"titles\": [\"...\", ...]}",
    "llm_format_line": "FORMAT to match: History Calling\u2013like evergreen documentary mystery / dark history / court intrigue (20\u201360 min TV-doc) \u2014 NOT FoC 3\u20134h epic, NOT 'What If \u2026?', NOT this-week news",
    "query_inject_template": "{theme} history documentary mystery"
  },
